<view class="page funds-page">
  <view class="wallet-hero">
    <view class="wallet-glow wallet-glow-left"></view>
    <view class="wallet-glow wallet-glow-right"></view>

    <view class="hero-top">
      <view class="hero-label">可用余额</view>
      <view class="hero-balance">{{ summaryDisplay.balance || '0.00' }}</view>
      <view class="hero-tip">余额可用于订单支付、退款回退和资金流水查看。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="hero-stats">
      <view class="hero-stat">
        <view class="hero-stat-label">冻结金额</view>
        <view class="hero-stat-value">{{ summaryDisplay.frozenBalance || '0.00' }}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="hero-stat">
        <view class="hero-stat-label">累计收入</view>
        <view class="hero-stat-value">{{ summaryDisplay.totalIncome || '0.00' }}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="hero-stat">
        <view class="hero-stat-label">累计支出</view>
        <view class="hero-stat-value">{{ summaryDisplay.totalExpense || '0.00' }}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card recharge-card">
    <view class="section-head">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">账户充值</view>
        <view class="section-subtitle">选择充值方式和金额后即可完成入账。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="update-text">更新于 {{ lastUpdatedText }}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="method-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{paymentMethods}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="method-card {{ selectedPaymentMethod === item.id ? 'method-card--active ' + item.activeClass : '' }}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bind:tap="onSelectPaymentMethod"
      >
        <view class="method-icon {{ item.id === 1 ? 'wechat-icon' : 'alipay-icon' }}">{{ item.iconText }}</view>
        <view class="method-body">
          <view class="method-name">{{ item.name }}</view>
          <view class="method-desc">{{ item.desc }}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="method-check {{ selectedPaymentMethod === item.id ? 'method-check--active' : '' }}"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="amount-panel">
      <view class="amount-label">充值金额</view>
      <view class="quick-amounts">
        <view
          wx:for="{{quickAmounts}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="quick-chip {{ selectedAmount === item && !customAmount ? 'quick-chip--active' : '' }}"
          data-amount="{{item}}"
          bind:tap="onQuickAmountTap"
        >
          ￥{{ item }}
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="custom-input">
        <view class="currency-symbol">￥</view>
        <input
          class="amount-input"
          type="digit"
          maxlength="8"
          placeholder="输入自定义金额"
          value="{{customAmount}}"
          bindinput="onCustomAmountInput"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="submit-box">
      <van-button type="primary" block round loading="{{submitting}}" bind:click="onRechargeConfirm">
        立即充值
      </van-button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card action-card">
    <view class="action-row" bind:tap="onNavigateFlowPage">
      <view class="action-main">
        <view class="action-title">资金流水</view>
        <view class="action-desc">查看充值、退款和订单扣款等全部资金记录</view>
      </view>
      <view class="action-arrow">></view>
    </view>

    <view class="action-divider"></view>

    <view class="note-box">
      <view class="note-title">充值说明</view>
      <view class="note-text">1. 充值金额会直接计入钱包余额，可用于后续订单支付。</view>
      <view class="note-text">2. 每次充值都会同步记录到资金流水，方便后续核对。</view>
      <view class="note-text">3. 若订单发生退款，资金会按照业务规则退回账户余额。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
